{"claims":[{"claim_text":"An age of intense capitalist crises exists, appearing as environmental destruction, stagnating wages, rising costs for workers, rapid displacement, violent police management of Black and brown people, brutal objectification of feminized workers, excessive working hours for those on salary, high levels of debt, an explosion of mental health problems, everyday social isolation, and an anti-democratic radical right bent on establishing minority rule.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Some time ago, the working class maintained solidarities based in the factory, in the neighborhood, and in common ways of life.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"These solidarities gave the working class access to at least some collectively shared life essentials.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Collective access to essentials protected the working class from unpredictable changes in the market, such as housing insecurity or rising expenses.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Decades of counter-revolution have destroyed most of these bonds.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"The working class has been turned into isolated individuals.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Few organic connections remain between members of the working class.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"As a consequence, the working class is forced to rely on the capitalist market for almost everything.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"The ongoing crisis of capitalism now appears in every facet of life, and the working class is more market-dependent than ever.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"The current era seems apocalyptic, while capitalism seems indestructible, creating a paradox.", "claim_types":["characterization"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Capitalism can be overthrown.", "claim_types":["prediction"],"evidence_ids":[1]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
```

